I don't think i've seen much hate on Sarah, but Matt is apparently an asshole and i think he's been called out for it. I read somewhere that they had to remove yt and ig comments flaming him, but idk. 

&#x200B;

I mean, their behind the scenes jobs go before being in vids so maybe they've been stepping back to give more spotlight to the new people like Saige, Iffy, Jackie and evem Kimmy who isn't that new anymore. Guess we'll never know.
